user - register:
api : /api/register/ (post)
payload : {
"username": "testuser",
"email": "test@example.com",
"password": "yourpassword123"
}

user - login:
api : /api/login/ (post)
payload : {
"email": "test@example.com",
"password": "yourpassword123"
}
(login would give back token for session)

user - profile view
headers: "key": "Authorization", "value": "Token <login token>"
api : http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/profile/ (GET)

Add Vehicle:
headers: "key": "Authorization", "value": "Token <login token>"
api: /api/vehicle/ (POST) payload: {
"vehicle_type_id": 4,
"license_plate": "KL07AB1234"
}

Allocate parking slot
headers: "key": "Authorization", "value": "Token <login token>"
api: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/parking/allocate/ (POST)
payload: {
"vehicle_id": 1
}

Total Parking available
api: /api/parking/availability/ (GET)


python manage.py runserver 0.0.0.0:8000

sudo systemctl status postgresql

sudo systemctl start postgresql




